{"code":0,"data":{"job_post_detail":{"id":"7670890632957856019","title":"结构仿真工程师-手机","description":"1.负责直板手机、折叠手机和平板结构仿真，评估性能和可靠性；\r\n2.负责手机关键器件（显示屏、相机、电路板等）的结构可靠性风险评估和仿真优化；\r\n3.运用仿真手段分析、验证、解决产品开发中的可靠性问题；\r\n4.针对公司产品，优化结构仿真流程和方法，提高仿真分析的效率和精度。","requirement":"1.硕士及以上学历，机械、材料或力学相关专业；\r\n2.具备有限元仿真能力，熟悉ABAQUS、ANSYS、LS-DYNA等一种或多种仿真软件；\r\n3.理论知识扎实，具备实验设计和动手能力；具备较强的沟通协调能力，责任心强；\r\n4.具备下列一项或者几项能力者优先考虑：\r\n（1）掌握python、tcl/tk等语言，具备一定编程能力\r\n（2）熟悉电路板以及芯片封装工艺、手机显示屏或者手机相机\r\n（3）具备疲劳、磨损等实验和仿真经验\r\n（4）熟悉械设计软件，如cad，creo等","city_info":{"code":"CT_11","name":"北京","en_name":"Beijing","i18n_name":"北京"},"recruit_type":{"id":"201","name":"正式","en_name":"Regular","i18n_name":"正式","depth":2,"parent":{"id":"2","name":"校招","en_name":"Campus","i18n_name":"校招","depth":1,"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"publish_time":1786018539646,"channel_online_status":1,"job_subject":{"id":"7659311908839262514","name":{"zh_cn":"2027届校园招聘计划","i18n":"2027届校园招聘计划"},"limit_count":2,"active_status":1},"job_function":{"id":"7178830559051874412","name":"硬件研发类","en_name":"Hardware R\u0026D","i18n_name":"硬件研发类"},"job_id":"7670890632957708563","city_list":[{"code":"CT_11","name":"北京","en_name":"Beijing","location_type":3,"i18n_name":"北京","py_name":"beijing","mdm_code":"MDCY00000001","node_status":1},{"code":"CT_125","name":"上海","en_name":"Shanghai","location_type":3,"i18n_name":"上海","py_name":"shanghai","mdm_code":"MDCY00000002","node_status":1}],"job_post_info":{"recruitment_type":{"id":"201","name":"正式","en_name":"Regular","i18n_name":"正式","depth":2,"parent":{"id":"2","name":"校招","en_name":"Campus","i18n_name":"校招","depth":1,"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"HighlightList":[],"JobChannelPublishList":[],"job_post_object_value_map":{},"address_list":[],"city_list":[],"correlation_job_list":[],"tag_list":[],"storefront_list":[],"target_major_list":[],"job_post_process_time_list":[]